  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The multi-year programme will strengthen FCDO agility in preparing and responding quickly to new disasters in the Caribbean. It will deliver one of the International Development Strategy&apos;s top priorities: providing lifesaving humanitarian assistance and preventing the worst forms of human suffering and the UK Caribbean Strategy&apos;s emphasis on better preparedness and effectiveness in disaster response.</narrative>
  </description>
